#: apps/fleet/templates/fleet/import.html:9
msgid ""
"Vehicles and drivers are read from the Vehicles and Drivers sheets. Nothing "
"is saved until you confirm. Rows are matched by plate and phone, so the same "
"file can be imported again."
msgstr "Avtomobillar va haydovchilar Vehicles va Drivers varaqlaridan o'qiladi. Siz tasdiqlamaguningizcha hech narsa saqlanmaydi. Qatorlar davlat raqami va telefon bo'yicha solishtiriladi, shuning uchun bir faylni qayta import qilish mumkin."

